IMPORT `P8-gate`
IMPORT `P8-art79`

-- Tests of Article 79. The group General applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113).

`Art 79 test on` MEANS Date 2 8 2026
`Art 79 test before` MEANS Date 1 8 2026

`Art 79 test route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
`Art 79 test placed` MEANS Date 2 12 2027
`Art 79 test placed earlier` MEANS Date 1 1 2026

#ASSERT `Art 79(1) the AI system presenting a risk is understood as a product presenting a risk as defined in Article 3, point 19 of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 79 test on` `Art 79 test route` `Art 79 test placed` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
